Personality sym91r: Symbian 9.1 with an RVCT-built EUSER (Sony Ericsson P1i)

sym91's tables, SWI return through ip and 9.1 loader layout, but UserSvr::DllTls/DllSetTls already pass the 9.2 arguments (uid 0), so the sym91 TLS shims must not be used (personalities/sym91r/README.md).

